"This action will also reorganize all the Employee's leaves by distributing "
"them across their contract calendars. If you do not want this to happen, you"
" can Update Overtime from a specific contract."
msgstr ""
"Esta acción tamén reorganizará todas as ausencias do Empregado "
"distribuíndoas nos calendarios dos seus contratos. Se non queres que isto "
"pase, podes actualizar as Horas Extra desde un contrato específico."

